(E'🏠 HOME & KITCHEN DEALS', E'Elevate Your\nLiving Space', E'Transform your home with premium essentials. Up to 40% OFF.', E'Shop Home', '/products', E'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618221195710-dd6b41faaea6?w=1600&h=700&fit=crop&q=85', E'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583394838336-acd977736f90?w=600&h=600&fit=crop&q=90', E'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583394838336-acd977736f90?w=500&h=500&fit=crop&q=90', E'linear-gradient(135deg, #092015 0%, #153c29 100%)', E'From ₹1,299', E'Smart Audio & Living', E'MEGA GIFT 40% OFF', 2, true)
